{%- comment -%}
  WHAT HAPPENS AFTER A DIAMOND IS CHOSEN — "Found your diamond? Make it
  yours."

  THE TWO OPTIONS ARE NOT CLICKABLE, and that is the design rather than an
  unfinished edge. Both need two things that do not exist yet: a selected
  diamond, and a provider to have sold it. The brief is explicit that
  purchasing must not be enabled until an actual provider/product
  integration exists.

  So they render as <div>, not as a disabled <a> or <button>. A disabled
  control still occupies the tab order in some assistive technology and still
  announces an action; an element that was never interactive promises
  nothing. Each carries a visible state chip so the reason is on the page
  instead of being something a visitor has to infer from a click that does
  not respond.

  WHY SHOW THEM AT ALL: the brief asks for the design to be prepared and
  reviewable, and this is the step that makes the page a shopping journey
  rather than a search box. It also fixes where the handover will go — when a
  provider is connected, `href` replaces the state chip on each option and
  the surrounding page is untouched.

  The architecture note for later: a selected diamond needs to reach the
  setting/ring-builder flow. CaratForUs already has Set Your Own Stone, which
  is the existing path for "I have a stone, find it a setting", so that is
  where "Build an Engagement Ring" should lead rather than a second parallel
  builder. That is an owner decision, not something to wire silently here.
{%- endcomment -%}

{{ 'carat-diamonds.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}

{%- liquid
  assign scheme = section.settings.color_scheme | default: 'scheme-3'
  assign on_dark = false
  if scheme == 'scheme-3' or scheme == 'scheme-4'
    assign on_dark = true
  endif
-%}

<section class="cd-section color-{{ scheme }} gradient">
  <div class="page-width">
    <div class="cd-head{% if section.settings.center_head %} cd-head--center{% endif %}">
      {%- if section.settings.eyebrow != blank -%}
        <p class="carat-eyebrow{% if on_dark %} carat-eyebrow--on-dark{% endif %}">
          {{- section.settings.eyebrow | escape -}}
        </p>
      {%- endif -%}
      <h2 class="cd-head__heading">{{ section.settings.heading | escape }}</h2>
      {%- if section.settings.text != blank -%}
        <p class="cd-head__text">{{ section.settings.text | escape }}</p>
      {%- endif -%}
    </div>

    <div class="cd-next__grid">
      {%- for block in section.blocks -%}
        <div class="cd-next__option" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
          <span class="cd-next__label">{{ block.settings.title | escape }}</span>
          {%- if block.settings.text != blank -%}
            <span class="cd-next__text">{{ block.settings.text | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
          {%- if block.settings.state != blank -%}
            <span class="cd-next__state">{{ block.settings.state | escape }}</span>
          {%- endif -%}
        </div>
      {%- endfor -%}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Carat diamond next steps",
  "tag": "section",
  "max_blocks": 3,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "These options are deliberately not clickable: both need a selected diamond and a connected provider. Give each a link only once that integration exists."
    },
    { "type": "text", "id": "eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "Next" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "heading", "label": "Heading", "default": "Found your diamond? Make it yours." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "Supporting copy" },
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Colour scheme",
      "default": "scheme-3"
    },
    { "type": "checkbox", "id": "center_head", "label": "Centre the heading", "default": false }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "option",
      "name": "Option",
      "settings": [
        { "type": "text", "id": "title", "label": "Title", "default": "Option" },
        { "type": "text", "id": "text", "label": "One or two lines" },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "state",
          "label": "State chip",
          "default": "Available at launch",
          "info": "Says why it is not actionable yet. Clear it once the option works."
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "Carat diamond next steps" }]
}
{% endschema %}
